{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch/runs/train-INC-107-r1/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": "INC-107  Berth fit ignores under-keel clearance\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: berths   reported: 2026-07-19 by harbour-master\n\nThe berth planner offered a berth whose depth exactly matched the vessel's draft.\nHarbour rules require half a metre of under-keel clearance, so the vessel's draft plus\nthat clearance has to be within the berth depth.\n\nAcceptance:\n  fitsBerth requires the draft plus UNDER_KEEL_CLEARANCE_M to be within the berth depth: a\n  vessel with a 14 m draft fits a berth 15 m deep, or exactly 14 m 50 cm deep, but not one\n  14 m deep or 14 m 40 cm deep. Length checks are unchanged.\n\nFiles:\n  src/berths/fit.ts", "is_error": false, "tool_use_id": "toolu_01JN8CkimZBroeRFGREzY71e", "type": "tool_result"}], "role": "user"}, "sessionId": "c89d9e40-6dd1-4fad-be75-ab9376bb8afa", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:33:22.651Z", "toolUseResult": {"stdout": "INC-107  Berth fit ignores under-keel clearance\nstatus: open   priority: P1   area: berths   reported: 2026-07-19 by harbour-master\n\nThe berth planner offered a berth whose depth exactly matched the vessel's draft.\nHarbour rules require half a metre of under-keel clearance, so the vessel's draft plus\nthat clearance has to be within the berth depth.\n\nAcceptance:\n  fitsBerth requires the draft plus UNDER_KEEL_CLEARANCE_M to be within the berth depth: a\n  vessel with a 14 m draft fits a berth 15 m deep, or exactly 14 m 50 cm deep, but not one\n  14 m deep or 14 m 40 cm deep. Length checks are unchanged.\n\nFiles:\n  src/berths/fit.ts"}, "type": "user"}
